  "text": "The PNG Geohazards Website is an authoritative national platform designed to consolidate, map, and disseminate multi-hazard information for risk reduction, planning, and emergency management in Papua New Guinea. It integrates geophysical, meteorological, hydrological, and geotechnical data into a single catalog and map service, serving as the public interface of the Integrated Spatial Hazard Risk Information and Mapping System.",
